{"id":"wb-4-74","name":"潞简王墓","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"潞简王墓","text":"潞简王墓位于中国河南省新乡市凤泉区潞王坟乡坟上村的凤凰山南麓，为明潞简王朱翊镠及其次妃赵氏的墓，是中国目前保存现状最好，占地面积最大的一座明代藩王陵墓。 \n1986年11月，河南省人民政府公布为第二批河南省文物保护单位。1996年11月，中国国务院公布为第四批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%BD%9E%E7%AE%80%E7%8E%8B%E5%A2%93","revisionId":93726658,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93726658","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b63e26498aa5dc73dcffdeda.jpg","title":"20240803_Mausoleum_of_the_Prince_Jian_of_Lu_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240803_Mausoleum_of_the_Prince_Jian_of_Lu_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b6/20240803_Mausoleum_of_the_Prince_Jian_of_Lu_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​潞简王陵，位于河南省新乡市","width":320,"height":213}}